<title>BRAZIL: Brazil ruling may cut CVRD price - report.</title>
<headline>Brazil ruling may cut CVRD price - report.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazil's highest court on Tuesday granted an injunction that may lead to a lowering of the base price for Cia Vale do Rio Doce (CVRD), the state mining concern due to be privatized April 29, local news agency InvestNews said.</p>
<p>The report said the Supreme Federal Tribunal (STF) granted an injunction suspending the transfer of 411,000 hectares of mineral properties in northeast Brazil to CVRD.</p>
<p>The injunction was requested by opposition legislators.</p>
<p>Court officials could not immediately confirm the report.</p>
<p>((-- Sao Paulo newsroom 5511 2485413))</p>
